#  The Color Clock App.

## Description about the appication.
This is a React application that shows the current date and time in a readable format using the date-fns package.

## How to Install everything in your local machine.
1. Fork and clone the repository.
2. Navigate into the project folder.
3. Run npm install to install dependencies.
4. Run npm install date-fns to install the date-fns package.

## How to run the necessary commands in the terminal.
- Run the following command in the terminal:
   npm run dev

- Then open the URL shown in your terminal.

